.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.backup.example

# data/ is app config state (untracked, never commit). `data/*` auto-covers any
# new runtime subdir; only the three traefik config-as-code files are tracked.
data/*
!data/traefik/
data/traefik/*
!data/traefik/traefik.yml
!data/traefik/dynamic.yml
!data/traefik/crowdsec-acquis.yaml
